I’ll first inspect the specimen metadata, diffraction range, and the frozen analysis guidance/tools. Then I’ll identify the ordinary chemically supported phases, build a replayable GSAS-II refinement, audit residual peak families, and only run the staged polish after the phase inventory is stable.

